#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:69
msgid ""
"If the HVM networking plugin is not listed, upload the plugin JAR "
"manually through :menuselection:`Administration --> Integrations --> "
"Plugins --> + Add Plugin`. The plugin JAR is published at HPE artifactory"
" and is also available in the |morpheus| release bundle."
msgstr ""
"Se o plugin de rede HVM não estiver listado, faça o upload do JAR do plugin "
"manualmente em :menuselection:`Administration --> Integrations --> "
"Plugins --> + Add Plugin`. O JAR do plugin está publicado no artifactory "
"HPE e também está disponível no pacote de distribuição do |morpheus|."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:72
msgid "OVS Bridge Domain Virtual Switches"
msgstr "Virtual Switches OVS Bridge Domain"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:74
msgid ""
"Before creating Standard or Overlay networks, ensure that an OVS Bridge "
"Domain virtual switch exists in the cluster. You can either create a new "
"OVS bridge or associate the virtual switch with an existing bridge on the"
" hosts."
msgstr ""
"Antes de criar redes Standard ou Overlay, certifique-se de que um virtual "
"switch OVS Bridge Domain exista no cluster. Você pode criar uma nova bridge "
"OVS ou associar o virtual switch a uma bridge existente nos hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:76
msgid ""
"An OVS Bridge Domain virtual switch is represented in |morpheus| as a "
"Network Router resource of type ``openVSwitch``. It acts as the "
"underlying virtual switching layer that backs both Standard and Overlay "
"networks, providing the bridge infrastructure required to connect "
"workloads and handle traffic forwarding within the cluster."
msgstr ""
"Um virtual switch OVS Bridge Domain é representado no |morpheus| como um "
"recurso Network Router do tipo ``openVSwitch``. Ele atua como a camada de "
"switching virtual subjacente que suporta redes Standard e Overlay, fornecendo "
"a infraestrutura de bridge necessária para conectar cargas de trabalho e "
"gerenciar o encaminhamento de tráfego dentro do cluster."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:80
msgid ""
"Ensure that the Name remains unique within the cluster and does not "
"conflict with any existing OVS bridges on the hosts."
msgstr ""
"Certifique-se de que o Nome permaneça único dentro do cluster e não entre "
"em conflito com bridges OVS existentes nos hosts."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:83
msgid "Creating an OVS Bridge Domain Virtual Switch"
msgstr "Criando um Virtual Switch OVS Bridge Domain"

