#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:142
msgid "Creating HVM Standard Networks"
msgstr "Criando Redes HVM Standard"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:144
msgid ""
"An HVM Standard Network uses an OVS port group on an existing OVS Bridge "
"Domain virtual switch as its backing. The system determines its VLAN "
"behavior through the **VLAN Trunks** and **Trunk Only** fields, which "
"define whether the network operates in Access, Hybrid, or Trunk-only "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Uma Rede HVM Standard utiliza um port group OVS em um virtual switch OVS "
"Bridge Domain existente como suporte. O sistema determina o comportamento "
"de VLAN por meio dos campos **VLAN Trunks** e **Trunk Only**, que definem "
"se a rede opera em modo Access, Hybrid ou Trunk-only."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/hvm_networks.rst:148
msgid ""
"A single physical VM NIC (VMNIC) can carry traffic for multiple VLANs in "
"Hybrid and Trunk-only modes, eliminating the need to assign a separate "
"NIC for each VLAN."
msgstr ""
"Uma única NIC física de VM (VMNIC) pode transportar tráfego para múltiplas "
"VLANs nos modos Hybrid e Trunk-only, eliminando a necessidade de atribuir "
"uma NIC separada para cada VLAN."

